    "title": "Simmons Preps For 1A State Championship - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Stephen Robinson ,\n3 hours ago HOLLANDALE, MS - The Simmons High Football Express has made its way to Starkville. The Blue Devils (12-0) will face Calhoun City (12-1) for the 1A State Championship from Davis Wade Stadium, home of the Mississippi State Bulldogs. The game will be played on Thursday, December 4, 4 P.M. Simmons... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
